warning: registry fields left unread: line 7: source.upstream has a value, which is left out

# source.upstream.owner with a block under it (the domain refuses a core skill with no owner)
$ skills list --registry <WORLD>/docs/02.yaml
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: parsing registry: skills: entry "beta": source.upstream.owner must not be empty

